        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SVY875010SBR, Decorative 10 Inch Ornate Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 10 Inch Ornate Door Pull is available in a wide array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, black, and polished brass. It has a 10 inch overall length and 7 inch mounting centers. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST03-specifications.gif?v=1704354609\" width=\"562\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions CST03 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in longer version: <a href=\"/products/17-inch-castle-door-pull-first-impressions-svy875017sbr\"><b>Decorative 17 Inch Ornate Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SVY875010SBR Castle  Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CST03-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262232\"><b>First Impressions SVY875010SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "10 Inch Ornate Door Pull",
                "description": "The 10 Inch Ornate Door Pull is available in a wide array of finishes including oil rubbed bronze, black, and polished brass. It has a 10 inch overall length and 7 inch mounting centers. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting.",
